Package: neuralign
Title: Unified Neural Alignment Framework
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Bradley Buchsbaum [aut, cre] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8268-1465>)
Maintainer: Bradley Buchsbaum <brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com>
Authors@R:
    person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", , "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8268-1465"))
Description: A unified interface for neural alignment methods that provides
    standardized objects (AlignmentData, AlignmentModel, AlignmentResult),
    a plugin/registry system for ecosystem extension, reference selection
    utilities, operator composition, and cross-validation plumbing with
    leakage detection. Delegates algorithm implementation to specialized
    packages like manifoldalign while providing orchestration and contracts.
